    "https://www.ic.edu/deposit": {
      "title": "Make Your Deposit",
      "description": "Make Your Deposit | Illinois College Skip to main content x Menu Search About About Mission & Vision Our History Office of the President Jacksonville Maps & Accommodations Past Presidents Accreditation Strategic Plan Non-Discrimination Policy Consumer Information Title IX and Sexual Misconduct Academics Academics Active Learning Majors & Programs Online Programs General Education IC Scholars Honors Program Phi Beta Kappa Honor Society Academic Success Catalog Registrar Academic Calendar Admission Admission Apply to IC Visit Campus Enrollment Deposit First-Year Students Transfer Students International Students Admitted Students IC Advantage Plus Finish in 4 Student Financial Services Meet the Admission Staff Request Admission Information Net Price Calculator Campus Life Campus Life Student Life Residential Life First-Year Experience Safety & Wellness Career Services Parents & Families SAFE IC Disability Resources Secondary Menu News Events Alumni Athletics Library Give Visit Apply Quick Tools Campus Directory Connect2 Employment Opportunities Portal Español Close Home Make Your Deposit Make Your Deposit Admission Menu Admission Apply to IC Visit Campus Enrollment Deposit First-Year Students Transfer Students International Students Admitted Students IC Advantage Plus Finish in 4 Student Financial Services Meet the Admission Staff Request Admission Information Net Price Calculator Reserve your spot in the class by submitting your $200 deposit. Deposit Online: There are two ways pay online by credit card, debit card, or e-check: Log into your Admission Portal with your email address and portal password. Pay online here without any login information Deposit by Phone : Call the Office of Admission with your credit card information at 217.245.3030 Deposit by Mail: Mail your $200 check made payable to Illinois College to: Office of Admission, 1101 West College Avenue, Jacksonville, IL 62650 Submit your enrollment deposit now and take advantage of these early deposit benefits : Priority Housing: Once your deposit is received, you will receive instructions on how to apply for housing. Keep in mind that housing applications are determined on a first-come, first-served basis! (mailed first of March) Early-bird class selection: When you are able to choose your course schedule early, the stress of reserving your seat in the courses you want is gone! (information available in March) First choice of orientation dates: READY, Set, Go! gives you the opportunity to familiarize yourself with the IC community as you meet staff, faculty and future classmates and schedule your classes for your first semester. (information available late spring) Most importantly, your enrollment deposit secures your spot on campus so you can rest easy confident in where life will take you next - Illinois College. ***Enrollment deposits are refundable until May 1 of each year by written request for those seeking Fall enrollment of that same year . Deposits for other terms are non-refundable.*** Back to top 1101 West College Avenue Jacksonville, Illinois 62650 217.245.3000 Online Complaint Form Facebook TikTok Youtube Instagram LinkedIn ZeeMee Footer About Academics Admission Campus Life Fixed Footer Menu Visit Apply Deposit Give Online"
    },
    "https://www.ic.edu/careerservices": {
      "title": "Career Readiness",
      "description": "Career Services | Illinois College Skip to main content x Menu Search About About Mission & Vision Our History Office of the President Jacksonville Maps & Accommodations Past Presidents Accreditation Strategic Plan Non-Discrimination Policy Consumer Information Title IX and Sexual Misconduct Academics Academics Active Learning Majors & Programs Online Programs General Education IC Scholars Honors Program Phi Beta Kappa Honor Society Academic Success Catalog Registrar Academic Calendar Admission Admission Apply to IC Visit Campus Enrollment Deposit First-Year Students Transfer Students International Students Admitted Students IC Advantage Plus Finish in 4 Student Financial Services Meet the Admission Staff Request Admission Information Net Price Calculator Campus Life Campus Life Student Life Residential Life First-Year Experience Safety & Wellness Career Services Parents & Families SAFE IC Disability Resources Secondary Menu News Events Alumni Athletics Library Give Visit Apply Quick Tools Campus Directory Connect2 Employment Opportunities Portal Español Close Home Career Services Career Readiness Center for Career Readiness and Experiential Learning Menu Center for Career Readiness and Experiential Learning What can I do with this major? GO! Program Students Alumni Employers Meet the Staff At Illinois College, planning your future happens every day. Nearly 100% of Illinois College students have jobs or are in graduate school within six months of graduation. That is because from the first day you arrive on campus, you learn who you are and where you are going. At the Office of Career Services, we assist you to match your interests and skills with career paths and graduate-level education, connecting you with hands-on learning experiences like internships, job shadowing, research opportunities and connections to professional mentors. You will Graduate READY. At Illinois College, we have been developing leaders since 1829. With 45 majors and programs, you will have the freedom to choose a path that leads to your dream career. As you decide your major, consider how it will build your strengths into a set of skills that will make you a leader in your field. Visit the Center for Career Readiness and Experiential Learning in the HUB at Lincoln Hall to explore internships and graduate schools. Visit our Student Work Office, to learn the details of how to find on-campus employment. Back to top 1101 West College Avenue Jacksonville, Illinois 62650 217.245.3000 Online Complaint Form Facebook TikTok Youtube Instagram LinkedIn ZeeMee Footer About Academics Admission Campus Life Fixed Footer Menu Visit Apply Deposit Give Online"
